# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Private working documents — never published
#
# This repository is public. These two files are internal: the engineering
# standards that steer development, and the product brief they are derived from.
# They stay on local machines only. Nothing that ships may link to them, so a
# reader of the public repository is never sent to a file that isn't there.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
CLAUDE.md
docs/goal.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets and local configuration — never commit
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pfx
*.p12
appsettings.Local.json
appsettings.*.Local.json

