# Local data volumes and generated fixtures
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.data/
backups/
fixtures/real/

# Snapshot output. The approved *.verified.* files are committed and reviewed; the received
# ones are what a failing comparison produced and are only useful until somebody has read them.
**/*.received.*

